1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
In the Marvelous Designer software, enter a shop that can buy clothing items.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
On the far left of the screen, there are the General, Basic and Store shop labels.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Select Store to open the shop.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:33,000
If you need to log in, please enter the user account and password on the Marvelous Designer official website at the window in the pop-up window.

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Enter your business account and your personal account.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Select the mouse to check the name and price on the object.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
For your favorite products, you can click the Like icon.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
You can enter keywords or use the filter to check the required categories.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
You can use the pull-down menu on the top right to sort the products.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
If you don't want to browse the products you have purchased, please open the display to have the product.

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
If you want to double-click on the product, you can find the detailed information of the product under the details tab on the right side.

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
You can see the seller's name at the bottom of the product name.

13
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
You can choose the purchase type of license.

14
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
You can see the purchase type of license at the bottom of the product name.

15
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
You can choose the purchase type of license.

16
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
You can see the purchase type of license at the bottom of the product name.

17
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Click the 3D Viewer button to view the product in the 3D environment.

18
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
You can adjust the rendering style of the product according to your needs.

19
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:39,000
You can also click the basic information and product description in the detail tab.

20
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
You can view the product pictures uploaded by the seller.

21
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Click the arrow button on both sides of the picture or select the page number at the bottom to view other pictures.

22
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Click the arrow button on both sides of the picture or select the page number at the bottom of the picture.

23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Let's take a look at the grapes and figs in this clip.

24
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Click the icon on the right of the video to watch the review.

25
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,000
There are several activities for buying.

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Click the Amazon problems tab on the upper left to view the changes.

27
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Click and close to see the conveyor belt option you just made in three units in this clip.

28
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Once you have this, please see the selected products and clear.

29
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Click again onências to read through and prepare for the next step.

30
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Click Next.

31
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Enter your purchase information and complete your purchase.

32
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Purchased products can be downloaded to my page under the product page.

33
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:36,000
When the purchase is completed, return to the general basic page and enter the purchased product, which can be used in Marvelous Designer.

